当前推荐全源码目标：dshanpi_t153_source_1g_defconfig（1GiB、16行）。
构建：scripts/build-uboot-source-1g.sh；打包：scripts/package-uboot-source-1g.py。
本板源码DDR4初始化/训练、eMMC SPL→U-Boot→OpenWrt已实际通过，DDR长期
可靠性仍未验收；CPU0-only，Linux/U-Boot地址窗口384MiB，复位/FEL待实测。
512MiB/15行dshanpi_t153_source_defconfig是保留的旧实验profile，不用于本板。
源码在files/board/dshanpi/t153/；详见../../docs/DDR-SOURCE.txt、
../../docs/BOOT-UBOOT-SOURCE.txt及../../docs/FLASH-SOURCE.txt。
源码目标支持FEL header脚本及SD/eMMC boot.scr；其持久启动不依赖厂商DDR库。

以下保留原 RAM-chainload 目标的说明：

T153 RAM-only port for upstream U-Boot 2026.07
================================================
Apply: python3 scripts/apply-uboot.py u-boot-work/u-boot-2026.07
Build: sh scripts/build-uboot.sh
Package: sh scripts/package-artifacts.sh (requires the OpenWrt build too)

The overlay adds a separate experimental ARM target. It deliberately does not
select ARCH_SUNXI: existing sunxi low-level setup and clock/GPIO layouts do not
match T153. Common ARMv7 startup/cache/timer, NS16550, MMC core, filesystems and
FIT code remain upstream. No vendor DDR object or vendor U-Boot tree is linked.

board/dshanpi/t153/mmc.c adapts the PIO command engine from upstream 2026.07
 drivers/mmc/sunxi_mmc.c (GPL-2.0+). sunxi_mmc.h derives from its companion header.
T153 glue uses the oscillator only (12 MHz card clock maximum, hidden /2),
CCU 0x02002000 + 0xd00/0x10 per host; gates/reset at +0xd0c, fabric +0x5c0.
SD uses TM1 180-degree input/output; eMMC uses TM4, no delay taps and sample
FIFO bypass at the conservative SDR clock. PIO avoids DMA descriptor changes.
Register layout, pin mapping and initial timing references were read from the
T153 SDK u-boot-bsp and the existing port; the SDK is not a build dependency.

This is not upstream merged, a complete SoC enablement, or a cold-boot port.
U-Boot has no network/USB support in this first profile. The factory loader
must initialize DDR, power, monitor, and clean caches/MMU via bootm before
handoff. See docs/BOOT-UBOOT-RAM.txt for exact scope and validation boundaries.
